            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144779,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono gli attributi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"> Aggiungono informazioni aggiuntive ai tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli attributi creano cicli di gioco</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Generano nemici</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gli attributi creano livelli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"> Aggiungono informazioni aggiuntive ai tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come appare il link nel browser?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Video game</code> come link con enfasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> come link normale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> con enfasi ma con un link non funzionante</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;em&gt;Video game&lt;/em&gt;</code> come link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Video game</code> come link con enfasi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/game-controls&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Controls\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non contiene testo tra <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato nel codice</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Manca il tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per farlo funzionare correttamente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Click to start Level 1!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"65\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144783,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi l'attributo corretto al tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to the Arcade!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/high-scores&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Take a look at the high\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   scores here! \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il problema con questo elemento <code>img</code>?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/sprites/player.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'elemento <code>img</code> manca un tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Manca un URL per accedere all'immagine</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta l'attributo <code>width</code> in questo tag immagine su <code>\"300\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/player-sprite.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"300\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
